r\n  single- and multi-GPU jobs admitted through Kueue.\n\n## Risks and Notes\n\n- Verification requires access to AMD GPU nodes; this epic can be implemented\n  ahead of hardware availability but cannot be validated without it.\n- The PyTorch ROCm worker images depend on upstream ROCm releases whose cadence\n  is controlled by AMD and the upstream communities.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37420,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a07a6fa63d415b0f","agent_id":"ab43bec2ef90fc9be","session_id":"1580befd-2500-423d-8dd5-ee8176ac89f3","uuid":"d2fc9cd5-790c-414a-b9ff-d956e681e776","timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:25:08.080Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9020 into epics"}
