ue quota configuration and admission for `amd.com/gpu` workloads.\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- Documentation topics state the supported AMD hardware, the driver\n59\t  prerequisites, and the validated model list, sourced from the validation\n60\t  campaign results and the productized runtime's support surface.\n61\t- Documentation covers PyTorch ROCm training usage for single- and multi-GPU\n62\t  jobs, including Kueue quota handling for `amd.com/gpu`.\n63\t- The documentation is technically reviewed against the implementations by the\n64\t  owning engineering teams before publication.\n65\t- The topics are published in the product documentation set.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- HLR-4 (P2): documentation states supported AMD hardware, driver\n70\t  prerequisites, and the validated model list.\n71\t\n72\t## Risks and Notes\n73\t\n74\t- Owning team assumed to be RHOAI Serving (the strategy names no docs owner and\n75\t  the Documentation component has no architecture-context file); confirm before\n76\t  scheduling.\n77\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6500e71cd098de2","agent_id":"a03f53f95020767ad","session_id":"1580befd-2500-423d-8dd5-ee8176ac89f3","uuid":"94c73b46-a113-4922-aa04-e269f3f27395","timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:27:10.719Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-ab68273141b57ecb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9020 decomposition"}
